 "summary": "The new Pl\u00fccker local bounds and subspace product-height bounds have no existing replacement in Mathlib or TauCeti, and the proofs reuse the existing Gram/Hadamard bound, Cauchy\u2013Binet, finite-support and subspace-height APIs. The ultrametric step is close to Matrix.norm_det_le_prod_of_norm_le, but that lemma doesn't apply to an AbsoluteValue: WithAbs lacks the SeminormedCommRing, NormOneClass and ultrametric instances, so this is not a located direct replacement.",
